IHP-Open-PDK SRAM simulation models
===================================

The following files are unmodified copies from IHP-Open-PDK
(https://github.com/IHP-GmbH/IHP-Open-PDK), revision
2bbec755dc67ca3db0261c3d6163e15735d66710, directory
