blackbox/RM_IHPSG13_1P_64x16_c2.v is an interface-only derivative of the
first file (port list only, no behavior), under the same license.

These are simulation models of a hard macro. They are not synthesized and
must not be listed in info.yaml source_files. The full license text is in
LICENSE.IHP-Open-PDK (identical to the repository LICENSE, Apache-2.0).
